        "added_bound_quotes": 0,
        "reworded_sentences": [
          "When an agent opens a support ticket, Lantern retrieves the ticket history and relevant account notes, summarizes them, and drafts a suggested reply that the agent reviews and edits before sending.",
          "Lantern never sends messages to customers on its own and never takes actions on accounts.",
          "The initial rollout covers the Retail Card Servicing queue (about 140 agents and 9,000 tickets per week).",
          "Any expansion to other queues requires a new ARB submission.",
          "- Average handle time for card disputes is 11.5 minutes, most of it spent reading prior ticket history and account notes.",
          "Lantern's security architecture follows a defense-in-depth model that combines strong identity controls, robust data protection, and resilient operations.",
          "The subsections below describe how each layer keeps customer data safe across its full lifecycle.",
          "Only tokens issued by the enterprise IdP for the `lantern-agents` application are accepted, and group claims in each token govern queue access.",
          "Root credentials for the Lantern accounts are managed by Cloud Platform Engineering through the standard account vending process and play no part in day-to-day operations.",
          "Lantern applies a comprehensive, layered approach to protecting data at rest, so that customer information remains secure wherever it is stored.",
          "All customer data is protected with industry-standard encryption, with keys managed through AWS's native key management capabilities.",
          "Each store is logically isolated with its own encryption context.",
          "The ability to decrypt is restricted to the service roles described in 4.2.",
          "Key lifecycle operations are governed by CRYPTO-OPS in line with Meridian's cryptographic standard.",
          "The ALB applies the security policy `ELBSecurityPolicy-TLS13-1-2-2021-06`, and calls to Corvid and Atlas CRM use certificates from the Meridian internal CA.",
          "Lantern is designed for resilience in line with its Tier 1 classification.",
          "Backups are copied daily to a vault-locked AWS Backup vault in the separate account `mtb-backup-prod`, and detailed rollback and recovery procedures are maintained in the runbook (MTB-RUN-LAN-001).",
          "The agent desktop VLAN, through the internal ALB, is the only inbound path.",
          "For each request, application audit logs record the agent id, ticket id, model id, latency, and whether the draft was accepted, edited or discarded.",
          "Ticket text is not logged."
        ],
        "note": "A missing quote is a reason for re-review and a hint to the evaluator, not a verdict."
